{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "tukiohub-complete-api-2024",
		"name": "TukioHub - Complete Backend API",
		"description": "Comprehensive API collection for TukioHub Event Management System\n\n## Authentication\n\n1. Register or Login to get JWT tokens\n2. Copy the `access` token from login response\n3. The token is automatically saved to collection variable\n4. All authenticated requests use {{access_token}} variable\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Authentication** → Login\n2. **Organizer - Events** → Create Event\n3. **Organizer - Ticket Types** → Create Ticket Type\n4. **Public - Event Discovery** → Browse Events\n5. **Bookings** → Create Booking\n6. **Payments** → Initiate M-Pesa Payment\n\nLast Updated: December 2024",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
